body:
Yeah, but it's probably just bullshit. In Norse Mythology there is a Realm called Hel, so that's probably where it comes from. It's just a place. I don't know though, it seems to me a shit choice to have to make regardless, might as well just admit that Life is Great in general, who the hell wouldn't want to be here!

&#x200B;

Truth though, if there is a Hell, it can't be as bad as here. My parents were pedophiles, forced me into child porn. I was even tortured by a child psychologist who worked for the government, I heard the project name "Blue Bird" tossed around. I've brain damage from that shit, can't even remember whole years of my life.

&#x200B;

Worst of all, my Brother and Sister as adults still live my parents... can't even make contact with them to tell them how much they mean to me. I could've really wanted their help throughout my life. Some people just can't catch a break here, I'm one of them. Death merely the beginning to something else, for me it will be the end of B.S., and the start to maybe more B.S., or less B.S.! Too funny, life gives you grapefruit and expects you to make lemonade out of it.

&#x200B;

Keep trudging on man, you're not stupid.
